        ],
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>\"Somebody has to stand where the trouble is.\"</em></p><p><strong>Bravo</strong> is the Violence Calling — the trade that kept its bearers alive after the Shattering. Umbrella: guard, soldier, bandit, bouncer, duelist, caravan outrider. A profession is a flavor label on the Calling.</p><p><strong>Knack — Shieldwall:</strong> Allies within reach add <strong>+1 Guard</strong> (+2 at Tier III). The Bravo is why the militia line holds.</p><p><strong>Aptitude kit:</strong> signature aptitude <strong>Melee</strong> rank = tier; secondary <strong>Brawl</strong> rank = tier − 1.</p><p><strong>Services:</strong> a standard job costs the tier fee (T1 10 / T2 30 / T3 90 / T4 270 marks), paid in <strong>Violence</strong> marks. Cross-pool ×1.5 friction applies as usual.</p><p><strong>Tiers:</strong> Apprentice → Initiate → Master → Archon. Grant the matching tier features alongside this class item.</p><p><strong>Awakens into:</strong> Aurablade or Bulwark. A Steward is a Calling that ignited into a Path — Surge is the mark of Stewardship, which is why no Calling banks or spends it.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        }
