      "type": "species",
      "img": "art/bbttcc/asli-icons/circuitborn_synapse_2.webp",
      "system": {
        "category": "ancestry",
        "source": "Bad Eden (2024 rules)",
        "tags": [],
        "description": {
          "value": "\n<p><strong>Circuitborn.</strong></p><p><em>“You are not a robot. You are a decision the world keeps making about itself. The networks are alive and they recognize you on sight.”</em></p><p><strong>Firmware of Identity.</strong> You do not eat, drink, or sleep. You enter <em>maintenance trance</em> when you rest. You reroll the lowest die on checks against poison and disease, and you are immune to magical sleep.</p><p><strong>Attention Resonance.</strong> 1/Soma Break, when a creature you can see is intensely focused on you, you may regain either 10 marks you spent this scene or Integrity equal to your tier.</p><p><strong>Informational Matrix Sense.</strong> You can feel active networks: radio, signal, ritual, rumor.</p><p><strong>Line Memory.</strong> Choose one Circuitborn line (Exo-Knight, Parallax, Salvage, Synapse). Your line grants Tier powers as you level.</p>",
