        "description": {
          "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Battlefield Presence</h2><p><em>People fight better when you are near.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>Allies within 2 squares of you reroll the lowest die on the first defense checks they make against being Shaken or charmed each combat.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>✍ Aura — the GM applies the reroll to the allies' first defense checks against Shaken or charm each combat.</em></p>",
